meta {
  name: 04_PartyFilter
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  Scenario: Narrowing the party list with partyFilter

    Given the unfiltered list contains both a main unit and its subunit
    When the list is filtered on the main unit
    Then only that main unit is returned
    When the list is filtered on the subunit
    Then the subunit is returned nested under its main unit
    When the list is filtered on both
    Then the whole hierarchy is returned
    When the list is filtered on a party the caller has no access to
    Then the party list is empty
}
